# Greenbelt Guardian, {1}{G} 2/2: "{G}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn." Cast on turn 1 off Mox Emerald and Mox Jet.
# Turn 3: Black Lotus gives GGG. Targeting Mox Jet (an artifact, not a creature) is refused with the green still in the pool; then the
# Guardian itself and Bot2's Ornithopter each gain trample (one G each, one G left). Trample is gone again on turn 4 (until end of turn).

